      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>3</strong></td>
        <td><strong>1921 census</strong><br/><span class="small muted">72 Pix Road, Letchworth, Herts</span></td>
        <td><strong>Henry Robert Wear</strong>, 32, b. Bermondsey, printer's machine minder at <strong>J. M. Dent &amp; Sons</strong>; <strong>Martha Maud Wear</strong>, 25, <strong>born Baldock, Hertfordshire</strong>; three children. Cynthia follows ten years later.</td>
      </tr>
