      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>5</strong></td>
        <td><strong>1911 census</strong><br/><span class="small muted">Church Yard, St Mary's Cottages, Baldock</span></td>
        <td>The same couple, married 1883, he now a labourer in a <strong>brewery</strong> — plus <strong>Hilda, b.1902</strong> and <strong>Ernest, b.1904</strong>, neither of them in the match's tree; and <strong>Joseph Walls</strong>, 84, widower, <em>father-in-law</em>.</td>
